  "body": "**`langchain-core` 1.8.0 drops support for Python 3.10**, which has reached end-of-life. The minimum supported version is now Python 3.11. Users on Python 3.10 will continue to resolve `langchain-core` 1.7.x.\n\nChanges since langchain-core==1.7.7\n\nrelease(core): 1.8.0 (#41796)\nfeat(core): Remove EOL Python 3.10 support (#41267)\nfeat(core): add decision models (#41765)"
